<p>Another, who has arthritis in both hands, wrote eight words that stopped me cold:</p>
${q("Didn't have to use the broom to sweep.", TP(5, "28 Sep 2026"))}
<p>And a school bus driver wrote about the other choice, the big blower:</p>
${q("A regular blower is to unwieldy.", TP(4, "13 Sep 2026"))}
